> Contracts and verification

The engine requires multiplier1 modulo4 and an odd increment, owns its raw word
and parameters, and preserves the historical default constants and raw stream.
Both raw next interfaces share the actual modular step kernel. Raw consumption
leaves the inherited normal spare unchanged; copied engines retain their own
raw/cache state. No cryptographic unpredictability, statistical independence or
multidimensional quality guarantee follows from the period theorem.

Consuming trace admits count+1 logical records and reserves all trivial step
storage before changing the caller. Its million-record default counts one
explicit original word and each actual step record, excluding
field/capacity/final-state/output/runtime copies and bytes/RAM;0 disables only
that optional cap. Jump records at most64 actual affine-composition iterations.
Reduced orbits accept widths1..20 and real step budgets0..1048576; each stored
state is actual, and only a repeated residue establishes complete/cycle
metadata. Empty budgets return the initial incomplete prefix.

Native tests verify raw recurrence and exact jumps, full low-bit cycles,
cache-preserving consumption, complete capture admission, full-range wrap
evidence and ownership. The ten-report batch passed 101 native CTest cases, 34
directly instrumented ASan/UBSan cases, 103 compiled/executed public examples,
515/515 scoped file definitions plus 10 exact LCG class definitions, and ten
representative clangd hovers. Independent Python integer/Fraction,
explicit-label graph search, quadratic sequence DP and full weighted-stump
references passed 69430 records across all ten topics, including a separately
fitted held-out Iris model. Frozen ordinary compatibility passed 1000 Lex-BFS
orders, 1000 library sorts, 100 LBG codebooks, 100 complete five-round
LogitBoost ensembles and 200 LLL bases; corrected LBG final labels/objectives
are intentionally excluded from historical compatibility. All 4 complete
programs executed and all 4 native figures were rendered and visually reviewed,
with clipped legends corrected and rerun. HTML/Markdown computed-result and
figure-byte checks gate legacy retirement. Repeatable receipts are retained in
`build/mepml-conversion/batch-204-213/`.

> References

T. E. Hull and A. R. Dobell(1962),
[Random Number Generators|https://doi.org/10.1137/1004061], SIAM
Review4(3),230–254. The full-period conditions are applied specifically to
modulus2^64; bounded reduced-orbit observations and the implementation’s actual
affine arithmetic are kept distinct from general statistical-quality claims.
